  "narrative": {
    "issue_register_md": "",
    "trend_md": "Wescom's digital evolution accelerated markedly after CIO Pellissery's 2023 arrival from Bank of America. Pre-2023 investments focused on foundational platforms: Corelation KeyStone core banking partnership (2010), Iron Mountain AZP-1 DR facility (2016), Temenos Infinity LOS launch (2021), and Snowflake data warehouse deployment (2022). Post-2023, the pace intensified: CISO Dy-Ragos hired and Palo Alto NGFW deployed (2024), Informatica IDMC unified 35+ systems (2024), OpenAI moved from PoC to production (2024), Red Hat Linux migration completed for 7 UNITRI clients (2024). The January 2025 wildfire response tested BCP operationally, and the February 2026 Tellerix partnership and SFMC evaluation represent the current leading edge. The Barracuda breach (October 2022-May 2023) sits at the pre-/post-Pellissery inflection point and appears to have catalyzed security investment."
  },
